            "id": "levelled_description_efe3606e6b56",
            "level": {
              "value": 13
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Through your heritage, you can replicate a hag's magic. Choose one common spell of 4th rank or lower from those available to a coven, including the spells contributed to a coven by a hag of your mother's type. You can cast this spell once per day as a 4th-rank occult innate spell.\n\nSpells available to all covens are augury, charm, clairaudience, clairvoyance, dream message, and illusory disguise. The eligible spells granted by the most prominent types of hag are: Cuckoo Hag nightmare, spellwrack; Iron Hag earthbind, spellwrack; Sea Hag humanoid form, mariner's curse, water walk; Sweet Hag charm, honeyed words, outcast's curse"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
